(text "Two FA-05 DATA-LINE repeater outputs" (at 20 15 0) (effects (font (size 2 2)) (justify left top)) (uuid ca50e5db-1c54-48cb-a7cc-c6c2ac02d062))
(text "Retained current-loop circuit, not Ethernet or RS422. Each repeater supplies its own isolated loop. CTR and wiring remain bench-verification requirements." (at 20 22 0) (effects (font (size 0.95 0.95)) (justify left top)) (uuid eb993659-61a5-4ae8-acd0-50323ecdcc3d))
(embedded_fonts no)
(text "J9/J10: contacts 2+5 share the loop supply; contacts 3+4 share emitter return. R40/R43 connect BASE to EMITTER. No output contact connects to board GND. LED drive is PD-only." (at 20 28 0) (effects (font (size .95 .95)) (justify left top)) (uuid ad6d033d-549f-426a-9ffc-f3188357da66)))
